## The data

These questions come from **Spider**, a text-to-SQL benchmark of human-written questions over
databases in many different subject areas (Yu et al., EMNLP 2018). They are real recorded
data, not generated examples.

Two things worth knowing before reading anything into a score:

- Spider is old enough and public enough that current models have very likely seen it.
- What is here is a small sample. Enough to tell configurations apart; not enough to settle a
  question about production.

The data is licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 and `LICENSE-DATA` in this directory carries the
attribution and the terms. It has to stay with the data wherever the data goes.

